Package: phonometrica
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Phonetic corpus annotation and analysis
 Phonometrica is an open-source tool for the annotation and analysis
 of speech corpora. It supports multi-layer time-aligned annotations,
 acoustic queries (formant, pitch, intensity), text concordances, and
 statistical modelling including linear and generalized linear mixed
 models and generalized additive models.
